                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I'm fighting back against Congressional Republicans' attempts to gut Medicaid for millions of Americans, including 680K of my neighbors across the Tampa Bay area, to pay for tax breaks for the wealthiest Americans.\n\nI am standing up for Tony, a 7-year-old from Wesley Chapel, FL who has leukemia and relies on Medicaid to survive. \n\nIt is clear: Americans need Medicaid and the ACA - lives depend on it.",
