                "reply_count": 33,
                "retweet_count": 27,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "House Republicans say they want to root out waste, fraud, and abuse in government? Here\u2019s their opportunity.\n \n@RepDarrenSoto and I are calling for a federal investigation into a shady $10M diversion of Medicaid funds in FL \u2014 money that was meant to help families afford health care but instead ended up fueling political operations tied to DeSantis allies.\n \nIf my Republican colleagues are serious about protecting taxpayer dollars, they\u2019ll join us in calling for accountability.\n \nRead more: https://t.co/hC6paXmDv6",
